power in a shop, selling dirt cheap.

Still later, I find (for the first time _ever_!!) a randomly
generated wand of wishing with charges... and later, find the
other one in the castle level.  So here I am, a rogue in Vampire
Lord form, with a +3 SoR, GDSM, GoP, Speed Boot, Stormbringer
(Kos gave it to me.  Pleasant chap, really) with no Titans,
liches, demiliches, master liches, rust monsters or black
